# Introduction

This document provides all the codes that I used for this coursework. I asked for AI assistance for generating the codes. It still contains some errors that I made during the process. However, I will just leave it there for you to see my process for generating the data.

# Content
1. SLR projection. SLR projection data was extracted from the IPCC AR6 data base that can be accessed here https://zenodo.org/records/6382554
2. Tide surge data. Tide surge data was extracted from the CoDEC dataset that can be accessed here https://zenodo.org/records/3660927
3. Flood map analysis. This analysis is conducted based on codes that is provided in the main reference. The code source can be accessed here https://github.com/geoye/attenuated_bathtub
